  "translation": "A y a yɛrɛ minɛ sarakabɔlan kan min o dilan-na Bet-El (Bɛtɛl) na, don duuru-tan don na, kalo sigiman na — kalo min na o y a bada bɔ a dusukun dɔrɔn — a ye sumaya kɛ Yisrayɛl (Isirayɛl) denniw ye, a y a yɛrɛ tugun minɛ sarakabɔlan kan walasa ka sunɔ di.",
